title: "GPCRome basal cAMP screen: processing, scoring and figure code"
abstract: >-
  Code, processed data and figures for the basal cAMP GPCRome screen in
  Howard et al. 2026: a pooled measurement of ligand-independent (basal)
  Gs/cAMP signalling across 946 barcoded human GPCR constructs. Scoped to
  Figure 1, Supplemental Figures 1 and 2, and Supplemental Table 1 of the manuscript.
